          <td>NotecardName / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/name" target="_blank">name</a></td>
          <td>a notecard in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in&#32;or a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a>&#32;of a notecard</td>
